{"id":"601685","name":"金枪鱼蔬菜沙拉","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/601685/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"油浸金枪鱼罐头","amount":"1罐"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"羽衣甘蓝","amount":"100g左右"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3-4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"无","amount":""}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好这些食材，盒马有卖。","img":"images/601685/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆和胡萝卜洗净后、去皮切块。","img":"images/601685/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"隔水蒸至熟透，取出放凉。","img":"images/601685/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋打成蛋液，加盐。","img":"images/601685/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"入油锅炒熟备用。","img":"images/601685/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"羽衣甘蓝洗净后，切段。","img":"images/601685/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用热水浇两遍，沥水备用。","img":"images/601685/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放凉的熟土豆、胡萝卜块和羽衣甘蓝摆盘。","img":"images/601685/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"接着放入炒好的鸡蛋和罐头金枪鱼肉。","img":"images/601685/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油浸金枪鱼罐头","img":"images/601685/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后在羽衣甘蓝那一圈浇上沙拉酱即可。","img":"images/601685/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}